# a project saved with the MOD track picked loads with its settings (ee03a90: trk_sel AUX_MOD was refused by
# settings_valid, the project came back as a new one's settings over its patterns, no sounds and 120 BPM, and the
# autosave wrote that over the slot): the tempo, a sound and the picked track kept, by SAVE and by the project's slot
wait 300
preset 2 acid_line acid
knob 2 cut 40
tap HOME
spin K1 12
wait 50
expect tempo 132
# ALGORITHM to the MOD track (after WEAVE), its Lanes page
spin ALGO 11
tap SEQ
wait 100
expect trk 14
expect page Lanes
tap SAVE
expect dirty 0
wait 40
reboot
wait 400
expect tempo 132
expect par2.cut 40
expect trk 14
# saved to another slot (the one opened at the start then)
projsave 2 modsel
reboot
wait 400
expect tempo 132
expect par2.cut 40
expect trk 14
